      "snippet": {
        "line": 69,
        "text": "viscosity c f = fun n x => o.epsilon n * (o.dr (o.dr f) n x + o.invRadius n x * o.dr f n x + o.dz (o.dz f) n x - c * (o.invRadius n x * (o.invRadius n x * f n x))); i.e. ε(Δ₀ - c R⁻²)f with Δ₀ = D_r² + R⁻¹D_r + D_z²"
      }
